{"id":"npc:%E7%99%BD%E9%94%A6","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"兰可的未婚妻。百年前的伥灾中为救下兰可身亡。如今的“白锦”是白锦墓前一串纸钱成伥。随云青萍登上邙山镇后山，在兰可受云青萍指点破开棋局后与兰可重逢，其后消散，消散前请求云青萍将自己带到白锦墓前烧掉。","spoiler":true,"source":""}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1873_1-1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1873_1-1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_1873_1-1$1.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_npc_1872_1-1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/9/97/Avg_avg_npc_1872_1-1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_1872_1-1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act19mini/level_act19mini_st04","lineCount":24,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":184,"line":185,"speaker":"白锦","text":"真好看！郎君手真巧。"},{"commandIndex":247,"line":248,"speaker":"白锦","text":"让他学习几年，说不定也能成一方高手，甚至是国手，到时候他就能走出这座镇子，去更远的地方看看啦。"},{"commandIndex":470,"line":471,"speaker":"白锦","text":"……"}]}]}